   "source": [
    "### Dataset #1: Sports Stadium Locations\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Important metrics: Latitude and longitude coordinates denote the horizontal and vertical coordinates of the stadium on Earth. They are composed of decimal degrees and, when put together, can pinpoint the exact location of a given sports stadium. These can be used to provide specific location information regarding the stadium that Python can parse through. This also helps clarify inaccurate team names that reflect a nearby major city or the name of the state rather than the physical location of the stadium.\n",
    "\n",
    "2. Major concerns: This dataset is from 2021 and may not reflect accurate team locations due to the movement of sports teams within the last 5 years. Additionally, its exhaustiveness (i.e., whether or not it includes all professional sports stadiums) has not been confirmed."
   ]
  },
